{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And I will set My dwelling in your midst.</b> My Shekhinah will dwell in your midst in every place that you are, as He promised before the [golden] calf, saying: בְּכָל הַמָּקוֹם אֲשֶׁר אַזְכִּיר אֶת שְׁמִי אָבֹא אֵלֶיךָ (Exodus 20:21)." "<b>And My soul will not abhor you.</b> Ever, as it says: לֹא יוֹסִיף לְהַגְלוֹתֵךְ (Lamentations 4:22), and as it says: כֵּן נִשְׁבַּעְתִּי מִקְּצֹף עָלַיִךְ וּמִגְּעָר בָּךְ (Isaiah 54:9)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:38:11.820358158Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}